> gcd x^3 - 1, x^2 - 1
gcd x^3 - 1, x^2 - 1
  = x - 1
  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime
  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)
> lcm x^3 - 1, x^2 - 1
lcm x^3 - 1, x^2 - 1
  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + x + 1)
    = x^4 + x^3 - x - 1
  check: both divide it exactly
> expand (x - 1)*(x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + x + 1) - (x^3 - 1)*(x^2 - 1)
  ucas: expand (x - 1)*(x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + x + 1) - (x^3 - 1)*(x^2 - 1)
expand (x - 1)*(x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + x + 1) - (x^3 - 1)*(x^2 - 1)
  = 0
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> gcd x^2 + 2x + 1, x^3 + 1
gcd x^2 + 2x + 1, x^3 + 1
  = x + 1
  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime
  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)
> lcm x^2 + 2x + 1, x^3 + 1
lcm x^2 + 2x + 1, x^3 + 1
  = (x + 1)^2*(x^2 - x + 1)
    = x^4 + x^3 + x + 1
  check: both divide it exactly
> expand (x + 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 - x + 1)*(x + 1) - (x^2 + 2x + 1)*(x^3 + 1)
  ucas: expand (x + 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 - x + 1)*(x + 1) - (x^2 + 2x + 1)*(x^3 + 1)
expand (x + 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 - x + 1)*(x + 1) - (x^2 + 2x + 1)*(x^3 + 1)
  = 0
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> gcd 6x^2 - 6, 4x^2 - 8x + 4
gcd 6x^2 - 6, 4x^2 - 8x + 4
  = x - 1
  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime
  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)
> lcm 6x^2 - 6, 4x^2 - 8x + 4
lcm 6x^2 - 6, 4x^2 - 8x + 4
  = (x - 1)^2*(x + 1)
    = x^3 - x^2 - x + 1
  check: both divide it exactly
